OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOutbreaks of
OL,6,Frain, locally heavy will continue to
OL,7,Fmove slowly northwards across the
OL,8,Fregion. This will turn light and
OL,9,Fpatchy later in the night as it clears
OL,10,Ffrom the south. Remaining rather
OL,11,Fcloudy.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FA damp start on Sunday with
OL,14,Fsunny spells soon giving way to
OL,15,Fshowers, these will prove heavy with
OL,16,Fthunder and hail during the afternoon
OL,17,Fand evening. Temperatures close to
OL,18,Fnormal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
