OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FUnsettled throughout with showers,
OL,7,Fthese locally heavy and with thunder.
OL,8,FStaying warm to start with but turning
OL,9,Ffresher as winds shift to a westerly.
OL,10,FBreezy at times.
